452
00:24:25,400 --> 00:24:28,320
Maybe the cola guys were trying to get the root beer guys who

453
00:24:28,420 --> 00:24:31,520
were getting very popular and trying to derail them with this.

454
00:24:31,620 --> 00:24:34,560
That's, no one will know for sure.

455
00:24:34,660 --> 00:24:36,560
After the ban, most root beer makers

456
00:24:36,561 --> 00:24:38,360
began developing artificial flavors

457
00:24:38,460 --> 00:24:40,560
to match the distinct taste of sassafras.

458
00:24:45,560 --> 00:24:48,000
Today, a few companies, including Hansen's,

459
00:24:48,100 --> 00:24:52,600
