How does the taste of Hansen's root beer stack up?

461
00:24:55,640 --> 00:24:56,580
It's not bad.

462
00:24:56,680 --> 00:24:59,580
I think it's going for the more generic root beer taste,

463
00:24:59,680 --> 00:25:02,060
but it's tasty, very foamy.

464
00:25:02,160 --> 00:25:04,420
It's got a good, creamy texture.

465
00:25:04,520 --> 00:25:05,920
It works well as a float.

466
00:25:05,921 --> 00:25:11,920
Anthony Shore has been reviewing root beer online since 1996.

467
00:25:11,921 --> 00:25:15,920
He's among a growing number of root beer aficionados who enjoy

468
00:25:15,921 --> 00:25:19,920
exploring and savoring the nuances of this unique soft

469
00:25:19,921 --> 00:25:20,920
drink.

470
00:25:20,921 --> 00:25:26,920
I've reviewed, I think it's 377 root beers, birch beers,

471
00:25:26,921 --> 00:25:27,920
sarsaparillas.

472
00:25:27,921 --> 00:25:30,920
Just root beers, I think it's 250 something.

473
00:25:30,921 --> 00:25:34,920
For me, the root beer tasting, it's a lot of different

474
00:25:34,921 --> 00:25:39,760
Root beer tasting, it's similar to tasting a fine wine.

475
00:25:39,761 --> 00:25:43,160
This will be my first taste of this soda.

476
00:25:43,161 --> 00:25:47,300
This is actually a butterscotch root beer.

477
00:25:47,301 --> 00:25:49,100
See how that first taste is, that first sip.

478
00:25:52,000 --> 00:25:53,080
Hm.

479
00:25:53,081 --> 00:25:56,340
Small head, but it's very creamy and sweet anyway.

480
00:25:56,341 --> 00:25:57,400
I like it.

481
00:25:57,401 --> 00:25:59,480
Raining-wise, this might be a little overly sweet,

482
00:25:59,481 --> 00:26:05,560
Maybe 81 out of my scale of 1 to 100.

483
00:26:05,561 --> 00:26:08,380
Chris Reed is a root beer lover too.

484
00:26:08,381 --> 00:26:13,260
Topping his list is Virgil's, a company which Chris purchased

485
00:26:13,261 --> 00:26:17,260
